## Retest summary (Spring)

| Finding | Gate | Pass criteria |
|---------|------|---------------|
| F4 | Always-on, Critical if applicable | Restricted role → 403 on admin endpoints |
| F8 | Always-on, Critical if applicable | Same-role peer → 403 or 404 on another `{id}` |
| F9 | Always-on, Critical if applicable | Disallowed `alg`, wrong `aud`/`iss`, or expired token rejected; blacklist fails closed |
| F10 | Always-on, Critical if applicable | Auth, denial, and admin/upload events logged without a token |
| F1 | Regression, High | User B identity on all APIs after User A logout + User B login |
| F3 | Regression, Medium | Renamed wrong-type file → 400 before processing |
| F5 | Regression, Low | Query string has no sensitive params; rate limits active. Missing authz is F4 |
| F6 | Regression, Low | Prior session dead on new login (if policy requires) |
